 {
  "id": "floating-surface-elevation",
  "name": "FloatingSurfaceElevation",
  "kind": "enum",
  "declaration": "public enum FloatingSurfaceElevation: Sendable",
  "abstract": "A solid panel floating over content — menus, popovers, tooltips, popup editors: opaque fill, a crisp hairline and the two-layer lift that says it is above the chrome.",
  "discussion": [
   "Solid on purpose. Labels on a floating panel have to stay legible over\nanything, and a live backdrop blur samples whatever happens to be behind\nthe panel, which reads as noise on fine content; the edge and the shadow\ncarry the depth instead.\nThe depth of a floating panel."
  ],
  "availability": [],
  "conforms": [
   "Sendable"
  ],
  "members": [],
  "module": "CoveUICompose",
